# CQ21 [Sensing & failures] Which failures affect turbine blades, with which severity and when were they detected?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT DISTINCT ?blade ?failure ?failureType ?severity ?detectionDate WHERE {
  ?blade a optimar:Blade ; optimar:affectedBy|^optimar:affects ?failure .
  ?failure a ?failureType ; optimar:severity ?severity ; optimar:detectionDateTime ?detectionDate .
  ?failureType rdfs:subClassOf optimar:Failure .
} ORDER BY ?detectionDate
